{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/toolpath-git/README.md","issuer":"mailto:1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T20:46:29.726560Z","id":"d3e641d70a51d65f811bd51e2169b267c38889010796ccd4dd1bba3c08dfe013","body":{"detail":"Commit message -> meta.intent (lib.rs:560), diff -> raw; the author becomes human:<slug> with no meta.actors identities (rfc-beyond-vcs-actor-provenance). docs.rs renders the last published crate (toolpath 0.7.1 et al.), not wip; this record is about the README on wip, which ships at the next release.","kind":"concern","ref":"git:04afa53","span":{"start":{"line":8},"end":{"line":9},"content_hash":"d9d07f70f3d55169e5fd8dca67f4a893e08c856661fe3616b87f534649bc0c25"},"summary":"toolpath-git README: every commit becomes a step with typed actors, intent and full diff — intent yes, typed actors are slugs without identities","tags":["claim:readme-git-every-commit","claims","docs-rs","session:claude-code:729d6bb8-59f0-4ddf-892e-603372433260"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/toolpath-git/README.md","issuer":"mailto:1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T20:53:27.455723Z","id":"b7b13c18b6281937f0dda0383d4fc198bade987e1da1343dd5d0152d5715475a","body":{"detail":"vcs@mapping (26ad6b4): commit subject becomes meta.intent, the body is dropped; author -> meta.actors; diff -> raw. docs.rs renders the last published crate, not wip.","kind":"concern","ref":"git:26ad6b4","span":{"start":{"line":8},"end":{"line":9},"content_hash":"d9d07f70f3d55169e5fd8dca67f4a893e08c856661fe3616b87f534649bc0c25"},"summary":"toolpath-git README: every commit becomes a step with typed actors, intent and full diff — the message body is dropped from intent","supersedes":"d3e641d70a51d65f811bd51e2169b267c38889010796ccd4dd1bba3c08dfe013","tags":["claim:readme-git-every-commit","claims","session:claude-code:729d6bb8-59f0-4ddf-892e-603372433260"]}}
